# Adjust DatabaseDirectory/TemporaryDirectory for your deployment.
Foreground yes
TCPSocket 3310
TCPAddr 127.0.0.1
DatabaseDirectory /var/lib/clamav
TemporaryDirectory /tmp
StreamMaxLength 20M
MaxFileSize 20M
MaxScanSize 100M
MaxRecursion 16
MaxFiles 1000
MaxScanTime 15000
AlertExceedsMax yes
AlertEncrypted yes
ScanPDF yes
ScanArchive yes
HeuristicAlerts yes
SelfCheck 60
